---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Battery Carbon Footprint (PCF) & LCA Engine | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Automated Product Carbon Footprint (PCF) engine compliant with EU PEFCR rules and ISO 14040/44 for battery life-cycle assessment."
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-radial-gradient">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-accent-emerald uppercase tracking-widest bg-accent-emerald/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-accent-emerald/20">
          PCF & LCA Automation
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-6">
          PEFCR-Compliant Battery Carbon Footprint Engine
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The EU Battery Regulation mandates strict lifecycle carbon accounting across 4 lifecycle stages: Raw Material Acquisition, Battery Manufacturing, Distribution, and Recycling. Our engine automates primary activity data ingestion and calculation with verified emission factor databases.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Stages Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 my-16">
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">STAGE 1</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Raw Material Extraction</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Mining and refining emissions for Lithium, Cobalt, Nickel, Manganese, and Aluminum cathode precursors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">STAGE 2</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Battery Manufacturing</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Dry-room electricity, electrode coating, cell assembly, and formation cycling energy consumption.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-400">STAGE 3</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Distribution & Logistics</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Maritime shipping, rail freight, and European road transport from gigafactory to OEM port of entry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-accent-emerald">STAGE 4</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Recycling & Recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">End-of-life hydrometallurgical recovery credits and recycled content substitution offsets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Calculate Your Battery Carbon Footprint</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Request a sample carbon declaration report and test your BOM against European PEFCR benchmarks.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-sm hover:opacity-90">
          Book PCF Demonstration &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
